                "headline": "Flood Watch issued September 26 at 12:10PM PDT until September 29 at 11:00PM PDT by NWS Las Vegas NV",
                "description": "* WHAT...Flooding caused by excessive rainfall is possible.\n\n* WHERE...A portion of northwest Arizona, including the following\nareas, Hualapai Mountains, Northwest Deserts and Northwest Plateau.\n\n* WHEN...From early Monday morning through Tuesday evening.\n\n* IMPACTS...Excessive runoff may result in flooding of rivers,\ncreeks, streams, and other low-lying and flood-prone locations.\nLow-water crossings may be flooded.\n\n* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...\n- Showers and thunderstorms capable of producing flash flooding.\n- Kingman, Colorado City, Valentine, Dolan Springs, Wikieup, Peach\nSprings.\n- http://www.weather.gov/safety/flood",
